// [🧰repo⌨️cli💻main🔖types🔖todos🔖entityrendering🔖artifactid🛠️string](repo://p/i/repo/b/b/cli/f/main.go/s/Types/s/Todos/s/Entity%20Rendering/s/Artifact%20ID/d/i/String)
